<title>UK: TENNIS-LONDON GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LONDON GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the London grass-court men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Daniel Nestor (Canada) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-7 (6-8) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat 15-Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) 4-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Stephane Simian (France) beat 10-Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>11-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Jean-Philippe Fleurian (France) beat 12-Cedric Pioline (France) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Martin Lee (Britain) beat 13-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 3-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Jens Knippschild (Germany) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>4-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Andrew Richardson (Britain) 4-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
